<BaseLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="How Siryus Hub uses cookies and similar technologies on siryushub.com."
>
  <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
  <p class="marketing-lede">
    This policy explains how we use cookies and similar technologies when you visit siryushub.com.
  </p>

  <h2>What are cookies?</h2>
  <p>
    Cookies are small text files stored on your device. They help websites remember preferences, keep sessions secure,
    and understand how pages are used.
  </p>

  <h2>How we use cookies</h2>
  <p>We may use cookies for:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Essential site functionality and security</li>
    <li>Remembering preferences such as language where applicable</li>
    <li>Measuring traffic and performance if analytics tools are enabled</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can control cookies through your browser settings. Blocking some cookies may affect how the site works. Where we
    use non-essential cookies, we will ask for consent where required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Updates</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The “Last updated” date below will change when we do.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions:
    <a href="mailto:management@siryushub.com">management@siryushub.com</a>.
  </p>

  <p><em>Last updated: March 2026.</em></p>
</BaseLayout>
